    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/fcaa238a90411bda88433ba8cc08dbbe.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><i>Active Opposition is a story-based game where we play the actions of Adam and his brother to rise in the criminal world.</i><br><br><br>STORY<br><br><i>An intelligence agent has been kidnapped. Since the operation is not official, the state cannot intervene in the situation. The most suitable name for this job is Adam, a newcomer to the city.<br>Adam strives to rise in the criminal underworld, he will find himself in the midst of schemes he never understood and he will need his brother\u2019s help to face the hurdles</i><br><br><br>\u0130STANBUL<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/dffff950021aede4821dd8cc0ee75c9a.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><i>You'll witness historical landmarks on a map inspired by Istanbul, and you'll shake the stones from their places in this elder city.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/b919c3d565619263472ba6b528d498f9.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br>ADAM<br>Ruthlessly eliminating his enemies,Adam does not consider the consequences of his actions<br><br><br><i>Take cover and survive the fight. If you don't spend your bullets carefully, you may get into trouble.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/cafc70af043805b7b62224e238db4f94.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/71e19f7dc4a1fd06760f7fd5c9eec547.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br>METO<br>Even though he wants to solve problems with his intelligence,events will quickly get out of his control<br><br><br><i>Climb and peek to get one step ahead of events</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/4028ff196f7970226514bc8b162b74bc.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/fa386f9aa901d485692d685c7e23d80b.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/fcaa238a90411bda88433ba8cc08dbbe.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><i>Active Opposition is a story-based game where we play the actions of Adam and his brother to rise in the criminal world.</i><br><br><br>STORY<br><br><i>An intelligence agent has been kidnapped. Since the operation is not official, the state cannot intervene in the situation. The most suitable name for this job is Adam, a newcomer to the city.<br>Adam strives to rise in the criminal underworld, he will find himself in the midst of schemes he never understood and he will need his brother\u2019s help to face the hurdles</i><br><br><br>\u0130STANBUL<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/dffff950021aede4821dd8cc0ee75c9a.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><i>You'll witness historical landmarks on a map inspired by Istanbul, and you'll shake the stones from their places in this elder city.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/b919c3d565619263472ba6b528d498f9.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br>ADAM<br>Ruthlessly eliminating his enemies,Adam does not consider the consequences of his actions<br><br><br><i>Take cover and survive the fight. If you don't spend your bullets carefully, you may get into trouble.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/cafc70af043805b7b62224e238db4f94.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/71e19f7dc4a1fd06760f7fd5c9eec547.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br>METO<br>Even though he wants to solve problems with his intelligence,events will quickly get out of his control<br><br><br><i>Climb and peek to get one step ahead of events</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/4028ff196f7970226514bc8b162b74bc.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227960/extras/fa386f9aa901d485692d685c7e23d80b.avif?t=1720814860\" /></div>",
